  "Time machine": `
meeting grandpa as a teenager ==> Start - Mia lands in 1965 and meets her grandpa at 16; Twist - he is very shy and can't talk to Grandma; Bigger - Mia coaches him with tips Grandma told her; End - he asks Grandma to dance, and Mia zooms home smiling
the machine only goes back five minutes ==> Start - the inventor shows off the time machine; Twist - it only goes back five minutes; Bigger - he uses it again and again to fix tiny things; End - he uses it to get the perfect cup of tea and calls it a win
a cowboy visits today and loves the toaster ==> Start - a cowboy falls out of the time machine; Twist - he is scared of the car but loves the toaster; Bigger - he makes toast all day and calls it hot bread magic; End - he takes a toaster back to the Wild West and opens a toast saloon
big lever ==> pull it down with both hands; it is stuck and you hang on it; push it and the room shakes; pull it halfway and land in the wrong year
time dial ==> turn it to 1920; spin it fast and it beeps; it is set to a very strange year; read it out loud: Ten thousand B C
flashing lights ==> they blink red, blue and green; they go faster and faster before you leave; one light stays on and you worry; the room fills with sparkles
seatbelt ==> click it on and give a thumbs up; it's stuck and you pull hard; shout: Hold on tight; forget it and float up
wristwatch ==> check it after you land; it is spinning very fast; it stops at the wrong time; it now shows the year, not the hour
`,
